      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "本当に素晴らしい踊りだった！\n今日を最後に店を畳むつもりだったが……\nもう少し頑張ってもいいのかもしれない。\nまた、うちの店に来てくれよ。",
        "official_en": "What a wonderful performance! I'm planning to close\nup shop today, but at least you've inspired me to\nkeep striving for success. See you again sometime!",
